 call, not RCA's.","verified":true,"action_taken":"none -- rca.verified remains true from prior investigation, no fields modified","open_item_not_in_rca_scope":"incident escalation.open_question (confirm recovery once inc-002 traffic resumes) is a monitoring/status question for alert-grouping or a future RCA pass once new traffic-based evidence exists, not something this pass can resolve given traffic is currently dark."}
