 own rule that absence of a code cause is a complete answer. Whether the specific flip was deliberately paired with inc-001 or an unrelated stuck toggle remains genuinely undetermined -- no log/trace ties the two flag changes to one triggering event, so confidence set to 0.85, not higher.","verified":true,"action_taken":"wrote rca object into incidents/incident-002.json (verified:true, implicated_file:null, confidence:0.85)"}
