{"incident":"incident-002","step":"pr_decision","action":"no PR opened","reason":"Nothing in the version-controlled open-telemetry/opentelemetry-demo repo is wrong -- the shipped upstream default (on) is already correct. The drift is purely in this live environment's runtime flagd state, which is outside version control and outside what any capability here may write to (project rule: no capability may call flagd's /toggle, ever). config_proposal per skill definition is 'without a diff' -- there is no repo artifact to diff or PR against."}
